================================================================================

MedVIGIL-authored annotations and benchmark metadata under data/medvigil_v1/
(legacy path data/medvlm_bench_v1/), including manifest.csv, grounding.csv,
probes_*.csv, triplets.csv, splits/, raw_llm/, mcq_raw/, qa_review/,
validation_report.md, README.md, DATASHEET.md, PIPELINE.md and croissant.json,
are released under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC-BY-4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The same CC-BY-4.0 grant explicitly covers the MedVIGIL-authored R4 response
letters, reading-key mappings, aggregate counts, validation metadata and scoring
results in data/r4_public/ and data/clinician_baseline.csv. Third-party source
questions, answers, options, captions and imagery retain their upstream terms;
this grant does not relicense that source content.

Source images (released separately on Hugging Face Datasets) retain their
original upstream licenses: VQA-RAD (CC0), SLAKE (research-use), ROCO (MIT-
style metadata over PMC-OA images), public CXR collections (dataset-specific).
MedVIGIL does not relicense imagery; consumers must follow each source's
terms.
